# CostaPulse design system

Before editing frontend code, read and obey:

1. `docs/FRONTEND-STYLE-GUARDRAILS.md` — binding visual rules.
2. `docs/TOKENS.md` — token usage.
3. `src/app/globals.css` — actual token values and typography.

## Non-negotiable

- Preserve the premium Mediterranean CostaPulse visual language.
- Use existing CSS/Tailwind tokens only; no second palette, arbitrary brand hex values or default purple/neutral shadcn theme.
- Reuse `src/components/ui` and `src/components/shared`; do not create page-specific copies.
- No new fonts, decorative gradients, glassmorphism, excessive blur/shadows or emoji UI icons without explicit approval.
- Mobile-first, WCAG 2.2 AA, complete focus/loading/empty/error/disabled states.
- When uncertain, preserve established patterns rather than inventing a new visual direction.
